messages.body:
@shipcast-verifier and @shipcast-publisher this is the backstage verification lab
linked to `shipcast-studio-desk`. Confirm in one line each that you have read
`shipcast-editorial-contract` and are standing by for handoffs from producer.

@shipcast-producer welcome to the ShipCast Studio Desk. In two lines, introduce
yourself, claim the `release-captain` role if available, and tell the release owner how
to trigger a verified release from git commits or a voice note.
